---
import InfoPage from '../components/InfoPage.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Image Size Reducer" description="Read the Image Size Reducer privacy policy and learn how local browser processing protects your files.">
  <InfoPage eyebrow="Your privacy" title="Privacy policy." intro="This policy explains what happens when you use Image Size Reducer and what information we collect.">
    <h2>Images stay on your device</h2>
    <p>Image Size Reducer processes selected images in your browser using local web APIs. Images are not uploaded to, stored on, or inspected by our servers. When you leave or refresh the page, the files selected in the tool are no longer available to the page.</p>
    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>The tool does not require an account and does not collect the image files you process. Your theme preference may be stored in your browser's local storage so the site remembers light or dark mode. Standard hosting or security logs may contain limited technical information such as an IP address, browser type, and request time.</p>
    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <p>The site may load fonts from Google Fonts. Your browser can request those font files directly from Google. No third-party image processing service is used by the reducer.</p>
    <h2>Updates</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy when the product changes. The latest version will always be published on this page.</p>
    <p class="text-xs">Last updated: August 27, 2026</p>
  </InfoPage>
</Layout>
